<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TOEIC WORD QUIZ - 중급 단계</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', 'Noto Sans KR', 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif;
            background-color: #faf8f5;
            color: #2c3a1a;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }
        .main-container {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            width: 420px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .level-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #fff8e1;
            color: #7a5c00;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 4px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: #004732; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: #466255; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .button-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
        .btn-mode {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e2ebda;
            padding: 18px 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: left;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }
        .btn-mode strong { color: #2c3a1a; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; }
        .btn-mode span { color: #5a6b51; font-size: 13px; }
        .btn-mode:hover { background-color: #edf5ed; border-color: #a7bfa4; transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .btn-back { margin-top: 20px; background: none; border: none; color: #466255; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline; }
        .btn-back:hover { color: #004732; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="main-container">
        <div class="level-badge">LEVEL 2 · 중급 단계</div>
        <h1>퀴즈 모드 선택</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">중급 단계 (700-800점 목표) 단어로 시작합니다.<br>원하는 시험 방식을 선택하세요.</p>

        <div class="button-group">
            <button class="btn-mode" onclick="startQuiz('eng_ko')">
                <strong>영 → 한</strong>
                <span>영어 단어를 보고 알맞은 한글 뜻을 맞춥니다.</span>
            </button>
            <button class="btn-mode" onclick="startQuiz('ko_eng')">
                <strong>한 → 영</strong>
                <span>한글 뜻을 보고 올바른 영단어를 찾습니다.</span>
            </button>
            <button class="btn-mode" onclick="startQuiz('synonym')">
                <strong>영문 동의어</strong>
                <span>제시된 단어와 의미가 가장 가까운 유의어를 고릅니다.</span>
            </button>
            <button class="btn-mode" onclick="startQuiz('antonym')">
                <strong>영문 반의어</strong>
                <span>제시된 단어와 정반대 뜻을 가진 단어를 찾습니다.</span>
            </button>
        </div>

        <button class="btn-back" onclick="location.href='/'">← 레벨 선택으로 돌아가기</button>
    </div>

    <script>
        function startQuiz(mode) {
            fetch("/level", {
                method: "POST",
                headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
                body: JSON.stringify({ level: 2, mode: mode })
            })
            .then(res => res.json())
            .then(data => { if (data.redirect) location.href = data.redirect; })
            .catch(err => alert("오류: " + err));
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
